## 🔧 Hardware Components

| Component | Purpose |
|---|---|
| ESP32-WROOM-32 | Main controller |
| 2 × 3.7V Li-ion Cells | Battery pack |
| ACS712 Current Sensor | Current measurement |
| DS18B20 Temperature Sensor | Temperature measurement |
| IRFZ44N MOSFETs | Cell balancing control |
| Relay Module | Battery/load protection |
| Voltage Divider | Voltage measurement |
| Balancing Resistors | Passive cell balancing |
| 16×2 I2C LCD | Parameter display |
| DC-DC Buck Converter | Regulated power supply |
| Breadboard / Zero PCB | Prototype implementation |

